#. InfoMetaData:	"OriginalString" : "Holden is now available!"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_UiGeneral.ST_UiGeneral
msgctxt "ST_UiGeneral,KEY_VS_MISSION02_DIALOG_DOG_TITLE"
msgid "Holden is now available!"
msgstr "Holden je nyní k dispozici!"

#. Key:	KEY_VS_MISSION02_DIALOG_START_BODY
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_UiGeneral.ST_UiGeneral
#. InfoMetaData:	"Is Unique" : "true"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Mission text"
#. InfoMetaData:   "OriginalString" : "Hey buddy, long time no see! I've got a
#. surprise for you. Just over the hill and past the river, there's a bunch of
#. deer. Feel free to choose one, and I'll whip up a great lunch for us. Also,
#. you can take Holden with you. He's the top bloodhound in Colorado and will
#. help you find your game after you take your shot. And if you're feeling
#. tired, go ahead and use my UTV. Just one more thing – when you're all set,
#. come back to me. I've got a special surprise for you!"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_UiGeneral.ST_UiGeneral
msgctxt "ST_UiGeneral,KEY_VS_MISSION02_DIALOG_START_BODY"
msgid ""
"Hey buddy, long time no see! I've got a surprise for you. Just over the hill"
" and past the river, there's a bunch of deer. Feel free to choose one, and "
"I'll whip up a great lunch for us. Also, you can take Holden with you. He's "
"the top bloodhound in Colorado and will help you find your game after you "
"take your shot. And if you're feeling tired, go ahead and use my UTV. Just "
"one more thing – when you're all set, come back to me. I've got a special "
"surprise for you!"
msgstr ""
"Hej kamaráde, dlouho jsme se neviděli! Mám pro tebe překvapení. Hned za "
"kopcem a za řekou je banda jelenů. Klidně si vyberte a já pro nás vyšlehám "
"skvělý oběd. Holdena si také můžete vzít s sebou. Je to nejlepší bloodhound "
"v Coloradu a pomůže vám najít vaši hru poté, co vystřelíte. A pokud se "
"cítíte unavení, jděte do toho a použijte můj UTV. Ještě jedna věc – až "
"budete připraveni, vraťte se ke mně. Mám pro vás speciální překvapení!"

