#. Key:	KEY_VS_MISSION03_DIALOG_BODY
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_UiGeneral.ST_UiGeneral
#. InfoMetaData:	"Is Unique" : "true"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Mission text"
#. InfoMetaData:   "OriginalString" : "What an amazing lunch this venison is
#. going to make! I knew you could do it, buddy. Now, while I get lunch ready,
#. feel free to make yourself at home. And remember the special surprise I
#. promised? It's the most incredible white-tailed deer you've ever heard of.
#. They call him the Monarch. The Monarch is like a mythical ghost that
#. wanders through the local woods, but nobody's been able to catch him yet.
#. What do you say, my friend? You up for the challenge?"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_UiGeneral.ST_UiGeneral
msgctxt "ST_UiGeneral,KEY_VS_MISSION03_DIALOG_BODY"
msgid ""
"What an amazing lunch this venison is going to make! I knew you could do it,"
" buddy. Now, while I get lunch ready, feel free to make yourself at home. "
"And remember the special surprise I promised? It's the most incredible "
"white-tailed deer you've ever heard of. They call him the Monarch. The "
"Monarch is like a mythical ghost that wanders through the local woods, but "
"nobody's been able to catch him yet. What do you say, my friend? You up for "
"the challenge?"
msgstr ""
"Jaký úžasný oběd tato zvěřina připraví! Věděl jsem, že to dokážeš, kamaráde."
" Teď, když připravím oběd, buďte jako doma. A pamatuješ na zvláštní "
"překvapení, které jsem slíbil? Je to ten nejneuvěřitelnější běloocasý jelen,"
" o kterém jste kdy slyšeli. Říkají mu monarcha. Monarch je jako bájný duch, "
"který se toulá místními lesy, ale zatím ho nikdo nedokázal chytit. Co říkáš,"
" příteli? Jste připraveni na výzvu?"

#. Key:	KEY_VS_MISSION03_DIALOG_END_BODY
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_UiGeneral.ST_UiGeneral
#. InfoMetaData:	"Is Unique" : "true"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Mission text"
#. InfoMetaData:   "OriginalString" : "The king is dead; long live the king!
#. Congratulations on winning the Way of the Hunter 2 showcase demo and see
#. you in the full game!"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_UiGeneral.ST_UiGeneral
msgctxt "ST_UiGeneral,KEY_VS_MISSION03_DIALOG_END_BODY"
msgid ""
"The king is dead; long live the king! Congratulations on winning the Way of "
"the Hunter 2 showcase demo and see you in the full game!"
msgstr ""
"Král je mrtev; ať žije král! Gratulujeme k vítězství v ukázkové ukázce Way "
"of the Hunter 2 a uvidíme se v plné hře!"

